radivine (0.1.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Introduce the native Radivine Control Center desktop application
    (radivine-control) with Dashboard, General, Wheel, Custom Actions,
    Diagnostics & Logs, and About pages.
  * Add terminal-independent background daemon management via systemd
    user service (/usr/lib/systemd/user/radivine.service) with detached
    fallback and single-instance window activation.
  * Add format-preserving TOML persistence (toml_edit) for config.toml
    and actions.toml with external conflict detection, .bak backups,
    and live hot reload.
  * Update the application menu launcher (radivine.desktop) to open
    Radivine Control Center instead of running raw radivine daemon.

 -- marawan6569 <marawan6569@gmail.com>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:30:00 +0300

radivine (0.1.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial public release of Radivine v0.1.0 ("Branch into action.").
  * Hierarchical radial wheel engine (radivine-wheel) with 1-to-3-level
    branching navigation, intent triangles, and viewport-aware placement.
  * Software RGBA8 renderer (radivine-render) with premultiplied alpha,
    Inter typography, Lucide icons, and damage-clipped MIT-SHM uploads.
  * Native X11 drag-and-drop (Shift mid-drag) and Invoke mode
    integration for Linux Mint Cinnamon and Nemo (radivine-platform).
  * Context-aware action engine (radivine-core, radivine-actions) with
    background enrichment, multi-target X11 clipboard service, D-Bus
    properties, and user-defined shell-free custom actions.
  * Separate read-only file preview application (radivine-viewer)
    supporting Full, Head, and Tail modes on multi-gigabyte files.

 -- marawan6569 <marawan6569@gmail.com>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0300
